rpki-client
------------------------------------------
OpenBSD portable rpki-client

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libexpat1-2.9.0-1
  libretls28-3.8.1-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  rsync-3.3.0-1
  zlib0-1.3.2-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libexpat-devel-2.9.0-1
  libretls-devel-3.8.1-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://www.rpki-client.org/

Canonical download:
  https://ftp.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/rpki-client/rpki-client-9.9.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack rpki-client-9.9-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./rpki-client-9.9-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/rpki-client-9.9-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/rpki-client-9.9-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(rpki-client)
  /etc/rpki/afrinic.constraints
  /etc/rpki/afrinic.tal
  /etc/rpki/apnic.constraints
  /etc/rpki/apnic.tal
  /etc/rpki/arin.constraints
  /etc/rpki/arin.tal
  /etc/rpki/lacnic.constraints
  /etc/rpki/lacnic.tal
  /etc/rpki/ripe.constraints
  /etc/rpki/ripe.tal
  /usr/sbin/rpki-client.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/rpki-client.README
  /usr/share/doc/rpki-client/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/rpki-client/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/rpki-client/README.md
  /usr/share/man/man8/rpki-client.8.gz

